<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Task>
    <Title>Config - RES ONE Workspace Database - Set Default Behavior - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[
<P>Configure the RES ONE Workspace Environment with a standard recommended configuration!</P>
<p>
	This Fixlet deploys a RES <i>Building Block</i> of recommended settings to your RES ONE Workspace Environment.
</p>
<P>
	This fixlet will <b>only be applicable against the BigFix Root Server </b>. The Building Block deployment will take place using the Root Server as a launching point. From the Root Server, this fixlet will launch the RES ONE Workspace Console over the command line to import the building block. If this task does not work it's likely there is a configuration issue with the console or a permissions issue with SQL.
</P>
<h5><FONT color=#ff0000><STRONG>NOTE:</FONT></STRONG> Settings below are configured via the this building block!</h5>
<p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Adds an application called, "Refresh Application Security Database" to the start menu.
		</li>
		<li>
			Configures RES ONE Workspace Startmenu appearance
		</li>
		<li>
			Configures RES ONE Workspace Lockdown settings
		</li>
	</ul>
</p>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>exists main gather service</Relevance>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[exists file (pathname of parent folder of parent folder of file of service "res" & "\pwrtech.exe")]]></Relevance>
    <Source>RES Software</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-12-05</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:56:29 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[// Source Release Date: 2016-12-05

delete __createfile
delete defaults.xml
createfile until __done
<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- RES Workspace Manager Building Block -->
